{"server":"tw","storyId":"act11d0_level_act11d0_01_end","groupId":"act11d0","stageId":"act11d0_01","title":"緘默不言","storyCode":"TW-1","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act11d0/level_act11d0_01_end.txt","sourceHash":"2e04427b7c02df23829c3db85794e73c9010879685c8e8d2fba8ea52e6d6bab5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在解決了暴亂的感染者後，羅德島一行得到了沃倫姆德的接待。但各懷心思的隱瞞似乎成為了隔閡，亞葉開始心生疑慮，希望趕緊去尋找幹員安托的下落。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"九尾狐活动 1下"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltstreet1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那、那些外人為什麼要攪和我們的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"還有你！塞弗林！你的兒子都死在那場火災裡了，你竟然還幫著那些飯桶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......把刀放下，告訴我，是誰教唆你們的，是誰給你的武器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"最後一次警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"叛亂的鎮民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......都持刀傷人了，躲回家裡又有什麼用？沒關係，憲兵隊會一個個敲門問責。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"只是問責？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"“問責”的具體過程沒必要告訴遊客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那你沒有什麼要對“遊客”說的嗎？“長官”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，你們很強，原來醫生還能這麼能打，真是長見識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"以及......非常感謝剛才的幫助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"一般來說，我們被稱為“幹員”的情況更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"現在可以告訴我安托在哪裡了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......這裡不安全，我們回去再說。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，亞葉姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，沒能在戰鬥裡幫上太多忙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，你已經很努力了。不如說如果早知道現在沃倫姆德是這個狀態，我就不會把你帶來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"就算只是解決一些糾紛，我也不想你太早捲入——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——唉，好好，小麗薩長大了。沒受傷吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒事的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"不過亞葉姐姐剛才一直心不在焉的，怎麼了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......這附近是隔離區。鬧事的感染者被趕走後，這裡就變回了安安靜靜的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......好像和其他地方沒有太大區別呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有太大區別，對，商店，咖啡廳，甚至還有音樂館和藝術沙龍的廣告......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"他們不用被衛兵追捕，不會被流放到凍土上，不僅有著正常的生活空間......怎麼講呢，好像還過得挺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者的待遇還真是多種多樣啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"如果大家都能對感染者這麼溫柔的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們就要失業了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！？雖然真的因為這種原因失業的話，我也會很高興的！但、但我才剛當上幹員......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"只是個玩笑啦......感染者能上街隨便走動這件事只說明沃倫姆德現在處境特殊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們有什麼瞞著我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？怎麼突然就——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"噓！小聲點！就是等那個憲兵走遠了才說的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這些感染者的反抗態度很奇怪。他們說過“火災”和“醫生”之類的話，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"還有那個憲兵明明知道我們的身份，我問了幾次安托的事情，只是回答一句她在哪裡很難嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"而且這裡......這座城鎮現在的氣氛有點過於詭異了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是萊塔尼亞也不至於讓感染者滿大街亂走，衛兵呢？為什麼沒有人制止？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"是有點奇怪......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我有不好的預感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"也、也許只是因為城鎮的情況不太好，大家情緒比較激動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是這樣就好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"二位辛苦了，真是抱歉，一來就被捲入了這樣的事情裡，我很慚愧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你是這裡憲兵隊的一員嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"不算是。不過沃倫姆德的大家都接受過正規軍事訓練，特殊情況來臨的時候，我們都有拿起武器的責任......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不過伯父......塞弗林長官確實是本鎮最高長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......一個偷懶抽煙的中年男？不負責任和怠忽職守並不能給人高深莫測的感覺，很遺憾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"長官現在這樣這是有理由的——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"不......沒什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，怎麼稱呼二位？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......幹員亞葉，這位是幹員鈴蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉，鈴蘭......這是你們的代號？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"在我們那兒沒有多少人會用真名工作，就和“安托”一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"安托醫生......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"看你的反應，你們認識。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......抱歉，我知道您心中疑惑，但塞弗林長官會解答你們的。這不是......不是我擅自做主的範疇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，請跟我來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你對他們說了多少？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"沒多少，大家不會不高興的程度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我是提了很多不近人情的意見，但你其實可以拒絕我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"別搞這種別出心裁的推卸責任，你也別指望能從我這裡得到什麼安慰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在全部如實告訴他們，你就開心了？所有人就開心了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是代表，你是沃倫姆德的頭兒，我們自己開不開心有多大意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不喜歡把事情變麻煩，特別是在感染者們又跳出來的時間點上接待客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......等等，停下，別在這裡點煙，也別擺弄弩彈了，放下，給羅德島客人們留下個好印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"好印象這方面你已經不用指望了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你——慢著，是窗外那兩個小姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"小姑娘，哈，看過她們戰鬥的樣子，你也會像那群公務員一樣質疑萊塔尼亞的學校是不是藝術課程佔比過大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，店長，他們到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，歡迎！羅德島的醫生！歡迎來到沃倫姆德！很抱歉讓你們捲入了本地的事件，為表歉意，晚上請一起——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您的好意，但我們只是來確認安托醫生的下落，不會多做停留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，她在哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，事實上——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"本地的感染者都知道“安托醫生”，你們在拖延時間，沒有這個必要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......二位，我很抱歉，但沃倫姆德發生的事情很複雜，我們需要一點時間來給貴公司一個交代，以確保——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"她失蹤了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"欸！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......憲兵，你不該在談及這種話題的時候還保持那種膚淺的輕浮態度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"真相就是輕浮的，很簡單，沒那麼沉重。就像你現在很憤怒，但也沒有太過驚訝，你早就猜到了不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的確接待過自稱為“安托”的感染者醫師，在沃倫姆德最艱難的時刻，她幫助我們照料了許多感染者居民，我們深表感謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"你們感謝的方法就是告訴我們，安托她失蹤了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"別這麼咄咄逼人......咳，咳咳——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"先生，您的臉色很差，您不該再抽煙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以的話，您應該接受一次全面檢查，可能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......不必，但是謝謝你的關心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"回到正題，在沃倫姆德鎮躲避天災抵達當前座標後，為了幫助我們安置感染者居民，安托醫生在城鎮邊緣建立了一處營地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"但是就在前不久，營地發生了一場火災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"......火災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"別擺出那麼難看的表情......根據目前的調查，那很可能只是一場意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"安托醫生在那之後就離開了沃倫姆德鎮，嗯，不知道去哪兒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"這種事情你還能說得這麼輕描淡寫——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"亞葉姐姐！冷靜，冷靜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"我們、我們會去自己確認的，但是，火災之後又下落不明，這種說法也太讓人不安了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我很抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"就算不那麼輕描淡寫，我能說的話也只是——“我很抱歉”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"安托醫生是個了不起的傢伙，她沒有萊塔尼亞血統，更與我們毫無瓜葛，她卻比任何一個人都高尚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"但是在沃倫姆德因天災而蒙受損失的時候，她沒有逃走，她向我們伸出了援手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我很尊敬醫生，所以我不希望她遭遇什麼不測。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"但在那場火災過後——你也看見了，有些感染者居民並不這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"這不怪他們，眼下城鎮斷絕了與外界的聯繫，偏離航線，缺乏補給，還有一群武裝感染者遊蕩在周圍停留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"武裝感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"外來者，都是感染者，全副武裝，除了萊塔尼亞人，還有些魔族。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"是“薩卡茲”，希望你知道這個詞的意義。至於武裝感染者，有別的資訊嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一群趁火打劫的匪徒，不是第一次了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？那為什麼他們沒有立刻來洗劫城鎮？為什麼要“遊蕩”在這周圍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"聽上去你話裡有話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"沃倫姆德缺乏對待感染者問題的敏感性，可以理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟長久以來，萊塔尼亞的感染者能夠與普通人相安無事地生活，這是一個奇蹟——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——也是讓某些人趁虛而入的契機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎麼說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，羅德島不光有醫生，我們是感染者問題對策專家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"有些事情......我更相信我們自己的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"比如......你知道“整合運動”嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"在大裂谷出現之前，在一些報紙上聽說這個名字，大多數都是和烏薩斯有關的報導，偶爾會在萊塔尼亞境內聽說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"但是對於一個旅遊小城鎮來說，那些語焉不詳、意義不明的官方說辭甚至不如隔壁鎮子的夫妻八卦來得吸引人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢？你覺得這其中有關聯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"——不，這是得確認之後才能做出的結論，現在我們暫且擱置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧......咳咳，無論如何，感謝你的情報。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"根據以往的工作經驗，我不認為你的一面之詞可以決定我們任務的走向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"那挺遺憾的，不過說實話我也沒指望你們會聽話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可能會在城鎮上做一些調查，根據“失蹤”的具體結果......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島會向必要的人索求必要的代價。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你那副表情，我也沒有理由拒絕你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"你們可以在鎮上自由行動，既然是安托醫生的同伴，沃倫姆德理應把你們視作貴客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！沒錯！請自由使用這裡的房間，樓上有著沃倫姆德政府最好的待客室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"二位長途勞頓，一定很辛苦了吧？請在樓上等待，我們會為二位準備——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，我還有點在意的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"可以現在就開始調查嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......過會我們會準備手續和通知各個居民，特事特辦，你們請便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"亞葉","speakerId":"char_345_folnic","isRemote":false,"text":"鈴蘭，我們走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鈴蘭","speakerId":"char_358_lisa","isRemote":false,"text":"呃？啊，好的！那麼沃倫姆德的各位，一會見！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......能瞞多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"你看到她的表情了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，也許羅德島不會是那種出於利益目的敲詐我們的公司，但他們會因為失去同伴而做出任何出乎預料的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"對我們而言，結果一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......可是那也不能算是我們的責任，不，說到底，難道不是那些該死的感染者放的火嗎！？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"我們沒有證據。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"那我們也不能白白擔責啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"我們盡可能寬容了這些感染者，但他們怎麼對待我們的？自從憲兵隊離開這裡之後，每天都有感染者不服從管理！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":".......是啊，真相總是輕浮的，看到這根火柴了嗎？火柴比真相可靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"你的確不該再抽煙了，聽醫生的吧，你還能多活幾年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"他們是“幹員”，我只聽“醫生”的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"油嘴滑舌......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......塔佳娜，你稍微跟上去看一眼，不要讓客人們遇到什麼麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔佳娜","speakerId":"avg_npc_069","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的！明白，長官！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"......讓她去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"哈——那個什麼......亞葉，對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我看到亞葉那副悲憤表情的時候，想到了什麼嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鎮民代表","speakerId":"avg_npc_068","isRemote":false,"text":"別賣關子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在想，為什麼塔佳娜沒有露出過那副表情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞弗林","speakerId":"avg_npc_066","isRemote":false,"text":"托爾明明差點成為她的丈夫，她應該感到悲傷的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_345_folnic","aliases":["亞葉"]},{"speakerId":"char_358_lisa","aliases":["鈴蘭"]}]}
